        <div className="bg-white p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-slate-200 shadow-sm text-center relative overflow-hidden">
             <div className="max-w-2xl mx-auto py-16 relative z-10">
                <div className="w-24 h-24 bg-blue-600 rounded-[2rem] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-8 shadow-2xl shadow-blue-200 rotate-3">
                  <ShoppingCart size={48} className="text-white" />
                </div>
                <h2 className="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tighter">企业 B2B 集采商城</h2>
                <p className="text-slate-500 mt-4 mb-10 text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed">基于智能 RPA 技术，实时同步京东企业购、苏宁 B2B、震坤行等平台的 API价格，确保企业享受同款全网最低协议价。</p>
                <div className="flex gap-3 bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 shadow-inner">
                    <input type="text" placeholder="搜索全网商品型号、SKU、条码或直接粘贴商城链接..." className="flex-1 px-6 py-4 bg-transparent outline-none font-bold text-slate-900" />
                    <button className="bg-slate-900 text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-[1.5rem] font-black hover:bg-black transition-all shadow-xl">智能比价</button>
                </div>
            </div>
